                dcterms:relation "United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC). Carbon monoxide, as a product of incomplete combustion, is relevant because its emissions are often associated with the burning of fossil fuels, which also produces carbon dioxide (CO2), a major greenhouse gas."@en ;
