                prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://www.preventionweb.net/hips-document/5d6328a32ddc84c5> .


###  https://www.undrr.org/terms/hips/ch0503
hip-term:ch0503 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                         hip-schema:SpecificHazard ;
