                dcterms:relation "While there are no UN conventions or multilateral treaties that specifically address nonpoint source pollution, there are some that focus on point source pollution that may have some relevance when considering nonpoint source pollution, as outlined below."@en ;
                dcterms:rights "Creative Commons CC BY 4.0" ;
                dcterms:source hip-document:a0a73451335121dc ,
