                dcterms:relation "The 1954 Hague Convention for the Protection of Cultural Property in the Event of Armed Conflict. This international treaty, in times of peace, requires risk management plans to protect cultural assets when an urgent situation arises such as the failure of a structure and fire (UNESCO, 1954)."@en ;
