                dcterms:relation "The Basel Convention on the Control of Transboundary Movements of Hazardous Wastes and their Disposal (1989). At the time of writing, there were 187 parties to the Basel Convention. At its 14th meeting, the Conference of the Parties to the Basel Convention adopted decision BC-14/12 by which it amended Annexes II, VIII and IX to the Convention with the aim of enhancing the control of transboundary movements of plastic waste and clarifying the scope of the Convention as it applies to such waste. (Basel Convention on the Control of Transboundary Movements of Hazardous Wastes and their Disposal, 1989."@en ;
